{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_174_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年，春，叔孫豹如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"二、仲孫羯帥師侵齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"三、夏，楚子伐吳。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月，甲子，朔，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"五、齊崔杼帥師伐莒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"六、大水。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"七、八月，癸巳，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"八、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子於夷儀。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"九、冬，楚子、蔡侯、陳侯、許男伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"十、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"十一、陳鍼宜咎出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"十二、叔孫豹如京師。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"十三、大饑。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_174_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_174","textTraditional":"五穀不升為大饑，一穀不升謂之嗛，二穀不升謂之饑，三穀不升謂之饉，四穀不升謂之康，五穀不升謂之大侵。大侵之禮，君食不兼味，臺榭不塗，弛侯，廷道不除，百官布而不制，鬼神禱而不祀，此大侵之禮也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}